chunks.text:
[Stillness]
{the music drops after the climax: the bass choir alone sings the four-note chant motif D, F, E, D slowly in unison, wordless}
{sustained drone and sparse bells, no drums}

[Pressure]
{the driving low synthesizer eighth-note ostinato on D and heavy percussion return, darker than before}
{experimental: very low, heavily distorted electric guitars play slow palm-muted power chords on D and C, doubling the ostinato, a wall of low rumble, no solos and no high guitar}
{the choir sings the chant motif with a fifth above and a low octave below, bells answer}

[Second Climax]
{the full bass choir in open fifths sings the chant motif loud and wide, bigger than the first climax}
{rising synthesizer swell, heavy drums, huge low end}

[Return]
{everything falls away except the sustained bass choir chord on D, exactly as at the very start of the piece}
{a low drone and one distant bell, no drums, no fade-out, no final hit}
